135	 // The shipped AMD device code has ONE body: the gfx942 (CDNA3) impl. A
136	 // gfx906/gfx908/gfx90a/gfx1100 device routed to the gfx942 code object
137	 // would run an incompatible ISA. setup.py offload-compiles for every gfx
138	 // the toolchain accepts, but the kernel BODY is gfx942-specific, so route
139	 // only a real gfx942 to impl 942 and fail loudly otherwise.
140	 // POLICY: LOUD-GATE (only gfx942 has a body).
141	 if (arch_name == "gfx942") return 942;
142	 throw std::runtime_error(
143	 "Detected " + arch_name +
144	 ": no kernel body for this AMD gfx target. The shipped device code "
145	 "has only the gfx942 (CDNA3 / MI300X) body. Supported: sm_90a "
146	 "(NVIDIA), gfx942 (AMD).");
